ons of Qwen-3D’s responses to visual question-answering tasks on\", \"origin\": [99.83509826660156, 640.6920166015625], \"bbox\": [99.83509826660156, 634.4872436523438, 381.10205078125, 642.6466674804688], \"line\": 0, \"block\": 38, \"dir\": [1.0, 0.0]}, {\"size\": 8.966400146484375, \"flags\": 20, \"bidi\": 0, \"char_flags\": 24, \"font\": \"NimbusRomNo9L-Medi\", \"color\": 0, \"alpha\": 255, \"ascender\": 0.800000011920929, \"descender\": -0.20000000298023224, \"text\": \" 3D benchmarks SQA3D and ScanRefer and\", \"origin\": [381.10205078125, 640.6920166015625], \"bbox\": [381.10205078125, 634.4872436523438, 553.4990844726562, 642.6466674804688], \"line\": 0, \"block\": 38, \"dir\": [1.0, 0.0]}], \"wmode\": 0, \"dir\": [1.0, 0.0], \"bbox\": [58.5, 634.4872436523438, 553.4990844726562, 642.6466674804688]}, {\"spans\": [{\"size\": 8.966400146484375, \"flags\": 20, \"bidi\": 0, \"char_flags\": 24, \"font\": \"NimbusRomNo9L-Medi\", \"color\": 0, \"alpha\": 255, \"ascender\": 0.800000011920929, \"descender\": -0.20000000298023224, \"text\": \"the 2D benchmark RealWorldVQA\", \"origin\": [58.5, 651.6510009765625], \"bbox\": [58.5, 645.4552001953125, 193.56088256835938, 653.6056518554688], \"line\": 1, \"block\": 38, \"dir\": [1.0, 0.0]}, {\"size\": 8.966400146484375, \"flags\": 4, \"bidi\": 0, \"char_flags\": 16, \"font\": \"NimbusRomNo9L-Regu\", \"color\": 0, \"alpha\": 255, \"ascender\": 0.800000011920929, \"descender\": -0.20000000298023224, \"text\": \". Green boxes denote objects relevant to the posed question.\", \"origin\": [193.56088256835938, 651.6510009765625], \"bbox\": [193.56088256835938, 645.4552001953125, 407.8847351074219, 653.6056518554688], \"line\": 1, \"block\": 38, \"dir\": [1.0, 0.0]}], \"wmode\": 0, \"dir\": [1.0, 0.0], \"bbox\": [58.5, 645.4552001953125, 407.8847351074219, 653.6056518554688]}]}], \"words\": [], \"links\": []}], \"metadata\": {\"format\": \"PDF 1.7\", \"title\": \"Qwen-3D: A Generalist 3D Vision-Language Model for Spatial Understanding\", \"author\": \"Lucy Lin; Ayush Jain; Yifan Liu; Katerina Fragkiadaki\", \"subject\": \"\", \"keywords\": \"\", \"creator\": \"arXiv GenPDF (tex2pdf:8def8d8)\", \"producer\": \"pikepdf 8.15.1\", \"creationDate\": \"\", \"modDate\": \"\", \"trapped\": \"\", \"encryption\": null}, \"from_bytes\": false, \"image_dpi\": 150, \"image_format\": \"png\", \"image_path\": \"\", \"use_ocr\": 0, \"form_fields\": {}, \"force_text\": true, \"embed_images\": false, \"write_images\": false}'"
